{"id":"utilite_","lemma":"utilité","pos":"noun","rank":4607,"glosses":["usefulness, use","use, purpose","bit part"],"ipa":"/y.ti.li.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ac/Fr-utilit%C3%A9.ogg/Fr-utilit%C3%A9.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"utilités"},"formAudio":{"utilités":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-utilit%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ce livre est d'une grande utilité.","en":"This book is of great use.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"book"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null]},{"text":"Ça ne m'est d'aucune utilité.","en":"That's of no use to me.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null]},{"text":"Ses conseils ne sont d'aucune utilité.","en":"His advice is of no use.","words":[{"g":"his"},{"g":"piece of advice","l":"conseil"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null]},{"text":"Je ne te suis d'aucune utilité ici.","en":"I'm of no use to you here.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Tu n'es d'aucune utilité.","en":"You're unnecessary.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null]}]}